  "question": "A program stores employee IDs (integers) as keys and their names as values in a hash table using separate chaining. If the table has 10 buckets and the hash function is h(k) = k mod 10, which bucket will the ID 237 be placed in?",
  "options": ["7", "2", "3", "0"],
  "correct_index": 2,
  "exp": "237 mod 10 = 7, so the correct bucket index is 7, which corresponds to the third option."
}

